{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/sdc02_0080.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/sdc02_0080.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "EE58D31F07F68497",
      "text": "你捉到阿罗拉的样子的\\n宝可梦了吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "EE58D41F07F6864A",
      "text": "怀着阿罗拉的心情\\n四处走走吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "EE58D51F07F687FD",
      "text": "……很遗憾，这只宝可梦\\n不是阿罗拉的样子。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "EE58CE1F07F67C18",
      "text": "哦哦！没错！\\n这只[VAR 0x0101(0001)]是阿罗拉的样子！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "EE58CF1F07F67DCB",
      "text": "它会骑上集中了精神力量的尾巴，\\n像滑行一样移动。\\r\\n还被称为“陆地冲浪手”呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "EE58D01F07F67F7E",
      "text": "它会摆动从头上长出的\\n金属材质的胡须，\\r\\n跟伙伴进行交流！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "EE58D11F07F68131",
      "text": "它闪着金光的胡须\\n是高灵敏的感应器。\\r\\n连数公里外的声音也能感知到！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "EE58CA1F07F6754C",
      "text": "它浮躁、任性、耐不住性子！\\n深受比起被别人照顾，\\r\\n更喜欢照顾别人的训练家欢迎！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "EE58CB1F07F676FF",
      "text": "它拥有优秀的体能，\\n圆圆的脸孔和光滑的毛发\\r\\n让它在阿罗拉地区备受欢迎！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "EE5C581F07F99C6D",
      "text": "它是为了解决垃圾问题\\n而从其他地区带到阿罗拉的臭泥\\r\\n不知不觉变成的样子！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "EE5C571F07F99ABA",
      "text": "它看上去像牙齿或爪子的东西其实是\\n毒素的结晶。只要碰到就会中毒，\\r\\n所以靠近它很危险！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_12",
      "hash64": "EE5C561F07F99907",
      "text": "它悠然惬意地长大，\\n所以不再需要精神力量，\\r\\n于是体内的龙之力量就觉醒了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "EE5C551F07F99754",
      "text": "它会喷出零下５０度的冷气｡\\n有时候人们会用过去的名字\\r\\n称呼它为凯欧凯欧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "EE5C541F07F995A1",
      "text": "它栖息在大雪冰封的深山中，\\n会从体毛中生出冰粒。\\r\\n人们曾把它敬为神的化身！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_15",
      "hash64": "EE5C531F07F993EE",
      "text": "它栖息于被雪包围着的山岳地带，\\n拥有钢铁般坚硬的冰雪脊背\\r\\n和柔软的肚子！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_16",
      "hash64": "EE5C521F07F9923B",
      "text": "它为了将雪拨开，\\n爪子长得又粗又尖，十分发达，\\r\\n能在雪原上奔驰！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_17",
      "hash64": "EE5C511F07F99088",
      "text": "它的身体是带有磁力的石头。\\n在磁力特别强的部分\\r\\n密密麻麻地附着铁矿砂！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_18",
      "hash64": "EE5C501F07F98ED5",
      "text": "它受到喜欢吃的石头影响，\\n全身都带着电，\\r\\n而且性格非常好斗！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_19",
      "hash64": "EE5C4F1F07F98D22",
      "text": "它的个性顽固且难以相处！\\n如果它不高兴了，就会放电，\\r\\n并以雷鸣般的声音吼叫！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "CE97A87B27A6F75A",
      "text": "什么！？[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你\\n已经捉到了吗？[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_01",
      "hash64": "49B42BEA169DA8EB",
      "text": "花了不少力气！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_02",
      "hash64": "49B42CEA169DAA9E",
      "text": "小菜一碟！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "CE97A77B27A6F5A7",
      "text": "你不光擅长对战，\\n竟然还擅长捕捉……[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "CE97A67B27A6F3F4",
      "text": "橘子学院的\\n水平之高可见一斑。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "CE97A57B27A6F241",
      "text": "葡萄学院的\\n水平之高可见一斑。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_20",
      "hash64": "EE5FBE1F07FC7F96",
      "text": "那好，请大家到这里集合～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_21",
      "hash64": "EE5FBF1F07FC8149",
      "text": "时间到了，\\n这次的课就上到这里！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_22",
      "hash64": "EE5FBC1F07FC7C30",
      "text": "给还没捉到的人留个作业，\\n下次上课前要捉到哦！\\r\\n好了，解散！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_mob_01",
      "hash64": "9A95444F99F3B847",
      "text": "啧～我得完成作业啊～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "CE97A47B27A6F08E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n蓝莓学园的课怎么样？[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_03",
      "hash64": "49B42DEA169DAC51",
      "text": "上得很开心！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_04",
      "hash64": "49B42EEA169DAE04",
      "text": "小菜一碟！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "CE97A37B27A6EEDB",
      "text": "哇，太好了！\\n连我都跟着开心起来了。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "CE97A27B27A6ED28",
      "text": "看来你们学院的课程\\n水平更高啊……！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_08",
      "hash64": "CE97A17B27A6EB75",
      "text": "对了！我得去社团活动室\\n露个脸才行！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_09",
      "hash64": "CE97A07B27A6E9C2",
      "text": "学园介绍就到此为止了，\\n但最后这件事请你一定要听！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_10",
      "hash64": "CE94237B27A3DF84",
      "text": "这所学园\\n盛行[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]蓝莓趣乐活动[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]，\\r\\n简称[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]蓝乐活[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_15",
      "hash64": "CE94207B27A3DA6B",
      "text": "蓝乐活是学园布置的任务，\\n在巨蛋内活动时会收到。[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
